      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_RECON_AMULET_09",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_RECON_AMULET",
      "CameraOffsetTime": "FA",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "단장님.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "団長。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 7,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_RECON_AMULET_09",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_RECON_AMULET",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "여정이 끝나면 단장님 곁에서 보좌하는 걸 허락해 주시겠습니까?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "旅が終わったら、団長のそばで補佐をしてもよろしいですか？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 8,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_RECON_AMULET_09",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_RECON_AMULET",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "관측사 일은 신경 쓰지 않으셔도 됩니다. 그만둘 생각이기에.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "観測士のことはご心配なく。辞めようと思っていますから。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 9,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_RECON_AMULET_09",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "…갑자기?!",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "…急に！？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 10,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_RECON_AMULET_09",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_RECON_AMULET",
      "UnitMotion": "SMILE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "농담입니다.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "冗談です。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 11,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_RECON_AMULET_09",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_RECON_AMULET",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "분위기가 무거워서 환기해 봤는데 어떠셨습니까?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "重い雰囲気だったので、場を和ませようとしました。いかがでしたか？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 12,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_RECON_AMULET_09",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "심장 떨어지는 줄 알았어!",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "心臓が飛び出るかと思ったよ！"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 13,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_RECON_AMULET_09",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_RECON_AMULET",
      "UnitMotion": "USN_UI_REST_START",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그렇습니까? 농담은 어렵군요.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "そうですか？冗談は難しいですね。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 14,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_RECON_AMULET_09",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_RECON_AMULET",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "…특별한 일이 없다면 관측사 일은 계속할 겁니다.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "…特別なことがない限り、観測士は続けるつもりです。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 15,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_RECON_AMULET_09",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_RECON_AMULET",
      "UnitMotion": "SPECIAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "여정에서 깨달았습니다.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "旅を通して気づきました。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 16,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_RECON_AMULET_09",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_RECON_AMULET",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "제가 왜 이 일을 시작했는지, 없으면 어떻게 되는지.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "私がどうしてこの仕事を始めたのか、仕事がなければどうなるのかー",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 17,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_RECON_AMULET_09",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_RECON_AMULET",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그리고 얼마나 좋아하는지…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "そして、どれだけ好きなのか…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 18,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_RECON_AMULET_09",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_RECON_AMULET",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "정년퇴직할 때까지 폴라리스에서 일하고 싶습니다.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "定年退職するまで、<r=ポラリス>観測士評議会</r>で働きたいです。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 32,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_RECON_AMULET",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "계속해서 저희들의 도움을 원하는 사람들을 돕고 싶습니다.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "働き続けて、私たちの助けを必要としている人々を助けたいのです。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 19,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_RECON_AMULET_09",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_RECON_AMULET",
      "UnitMotion": "SERIOUS",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "하지만 단장님을 보좌하면서 보람을 느꼈던 것 또한 사실.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "しかし、団長の補佐をしながらやりがいを感じたのもまた事実。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 20,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_RECON_AMULET_09",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_RECON_AMULET",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그렇기에…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "そのため…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 21,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_RECON_AMULET_09",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_RECON_AMULET",
      "UnitMotion": "SPECIAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "혹시라도 은퇴하거나 마음이 바뀌게 되면.",
